<title>UK: Daewoo Corp sets 200 million mark three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Corp sets 200 million mark three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Daewoo Corp</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    18.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.40     SPREAD	+97 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE     SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.20	LIST FEE    0.30</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 112</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
